{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Plain":"代数拓扑"},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"奇异上同调"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"奇异上同调"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>拓扑空间的<strong>奇异上同调</strong>是其"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"上同调","text":"上同调"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>拓扑空间 $X$ "},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"即是其"},{"Local":{"url":"奇异单纯集","text":"奇异单纯集"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Sing}X$ "},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>与层上同调的联系</h3>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 对于局部可缩拓扑空间 $X$ 与 Abel 群 $A$, 奇异上同调 $H^n(X,A)$ 自然同构于"},{"Local":{"url":"层上同调","text":"层上同调"}},{"Plain":" $H^n(X,\\underline{A})$.</p>\n"}]}}